hadiths[119]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1355","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi doosre ki bai' par bai' na kare."
"1356","[AI-translation] Malik aur Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Abu Zinad se, A'raj se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi doosre ki bai' par bai' na kare."
"1357","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Ibn Musayyab se, Abu Hurairah se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi apne bhai ki bai' par bai' na kare."
"1358","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Ayyub se, Ibn Sireen se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se usi ki tarah. Yeh chaaron hadeesein Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees ke doosre hisse se nikali."
"1359","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shehri dehati ke liye bai' na kare."
"1360","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Abu Zinad se, Jabir se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shehri dehati ke liye bai' na kare. Logon ko chhod do; Allah un mein se baaz ko baaz se rizq deta hai."
"1361","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abu Zinad se, A'raj se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Samaan se aage milne na jao. Yeh teenon hadeesein Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees ke doosre hisse se nikali."
"1362","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Muhammad bin Yahya bin Hibban se aur Abu Zinad se, A'raj se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mulamasah aur munabazah se mana farmaya. Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i mein nikali."
"1363","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne najsh se mana farmaya."
"1364","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Ibn Musayyab se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Najsh na karo."
"1365","[AI-translation] Sufyan aur Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abu Zinad se, A'raj se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se usi ki tarah."
"1366","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Ayyub se, Ibn Sireen se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se usi ki tarah. Yeh chaaron hadeesein Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees ke doosre hisse se nikali."
"1367","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Salim se, apne walid se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo khajoor ke darakht ko us ke gobh hone ke baad beche, to us ka phal bechne wale ka hai magar khareedne wala shart lagaye."
"1368","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo khajoor ke darakht ko beche jab woh gobh ho chuka ho, to us ka phal bechne wale ka hai magar khareedne wala shart lagaye."
"1369","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Salim se, apne walid se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo ghulam ko beche aur us ka maal ho, to us ka maal bechne wale ka hai, magar khareedne wala shart lagaye. Dono hadeesein Kitab Buyoo' se aur teesri Kitab Risalah se nikali."
"1370","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dono bai' karne wale, un mein se har ek ko apne sathi par ikhtiyar hai jab tak woh alag na hon, magar khiyar wali bai'. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Aur Ibn Umar jinhon ne use Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna tha, jab koi cheez khareedte aur chahte ke woh un ke liye lazim ho jaye, apne sathi se alag hote, thoda chalte phir wapas aate."
"1371","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein is ki khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se."
"1372","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Abdullah bin Umar se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dono bai' karne wale ikhtiyar wale hain, un mein se har ek ko apne sathi par ikhtiyar hai jab tak woh alag na hon, magar khiyar wali bai'."
"1373","[AI-translation] Aur unhon ne hamein Ibn Juraij se khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Nafi' maula Ibn Umar ne imla karaya: Ibn Umar ne unhein khabar di: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab dono bai' karne wale bai' karen, un mein se har ek ko apni bai' mein ikhtiyar hai jab tak woh alag na hon ya un dono ki bai' khiyar par ho. Nafi' ne farmaya: Aur Ibn Umar jab bai' khareedte aur bai' ko lazim karna chahte, thoda chalte phir wapas aate."
"1374","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Dinar se, Ibn Umar se. Aur hamein siqah ne khabar di, Hammad bin Salamah se, Qatadah se, Abul Khaleel se, Abdullah bin Haris se, Hakeem bin Hizam se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dono bai' karne wale ikhtiyar wale hain jab tak woh alag na hon. Phir agar woh dono sach bolen aur bayan karen, un dono ki bai' mein barkat wajib ho gayi. Aur agar woh dono jhoot bolen aur chhupayen, un dono ki bai' se barkat mita di gayi."
"1375","[AI-translation] Hamein siqah ne khabar di, Hammad bin Zaid se, Jameel bin Murrah se, Abul Wazi' se, unhon ne farmaya: Hum ek jang mein the. To hamare ek sathi ne ek aadmi se ghoda becha. Jab hum kooch ka irada karte to us ne Abu Barzah se jhagda kiya. To Abu Barzah ne farmaya: Main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Dono bechne wale ikhtiyar wale hain jab tak woh alag na hon."
"1376","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Tawus se, apne walid se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko bai' ke baad ikhtiyar diya. To woh aadmi bola: Allah tumhein umr de, tum kaun ho? To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Quraish mein se ek shakhs. Unhon ne farmaya: Aur mere walid qasam khate the ke ikhtiyar bai' ke baad hi hai. Pehli aur sanad baghair matn ke us ke baad, Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i mein, aur saatwin ke aakhir tak Kitab Buyoo' se, aur woh us mein sab se pehli hain."
"1377","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe us ne khabar di jis par main shak nahin karta, Ibn Abi Zi'b se, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Makhlad bin Khafaf ne khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne ek ghulam khareeda aur us se faida uthaya. Phir mujhe us mein ek aib maloom hua. To main ne us mein Umar bin Abdul Aziz se jhagda kiya. To unhon ne mere haq mein us ke wapas karne ka faisla farmaya, aur mujh par us ke faide ke wapas karne ka faisla farmaya. Phir main Urwah ke paas aaya aur unhein khabar di. To unhon ne farmaya: Main aaj shaam un ke paas jaunga, aur unhein khabar dunga ke Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ne mujhe khabar di ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is jaisi mein faisla farmaya ke kharaj zamanat ki wajah se hai. Phir main jaldi Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas gaya, aur unhein woh khabar di jo Urwah ne mujhe Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se khabar di thi. To Umar ne farmaya: Mere faisle jo main ne kiya kitna aasan hai. Allah janta hai ke main ne us mein haq ke siva irada nahin kiya, phir mujhe us mein Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sunnat pahunchi hai, to main Umar ke faisle ko radd karta hun aur Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sunnat ko nafiz karta hun. Phir Urwah shaam ko un ke paas gaye. To unhon ne mere haq mein faisla farmaya ke main kharaj lun us se jis ke liye unhon ne us par faisla farmaya tha."
"1378","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Salim ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Abi Zi'b se, Makhlad bin Khafaf se, Urwah se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne faisla farmaya ke kharaj zamanat ki wajah se hai."
"1379","[AI-translation] Muslim bin Khalid ne hamein khabar di, Hisham se, apne walid se, Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kharaj zamanat ki wajah se hai."
"1380","[AI-translation] Shafi'i ne apni kitab mein farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Abu Salamah se: Abdur Rahman bin Auf ne Aasim bin Adi se ek laundi khareedi. To unhein khabar di gayi ke us ka shohar hai. To unhon ne use wapas kar diya. Pehli Kitab Risalah se, doosri aur teesri Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees ke doosre hisse se, aur chauthi Kitab Ikhtilaf Ali wa Abdillah mein se, us mein se jo Rabi' ne Shafi'i se nahin suna."
"1381","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abu Zinad se, A'raj se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Oontniyon aur bakriyon ka doodh na roko. Phir agar use us ke baad khareede, to woh dohne ke baad do behtar nazar ke darmiyan hai: agar use pasand kare to use rakhe; aur agar napasand kare to use wapas kare aur ek sa' khajoor."
"1382","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Abu Zinad se, A'raj se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Oontniyon aur bakriyon ka doodh na roko. Jo use us ke baad khareede, to woh dohne ke baad do behtar nazar ke darmiyan hai: agar use pasand kare to use rakhe; aur agar napasand kare to use wapas kare aur ek sa' khajoor."
"1383","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Ayyub se, Ibn Sireen se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se usi ki tarah; magar unhon ne farmaya: Use wapas kare aur ek sa' khajoor, gehun nahin. Yeh teenon hadeesein Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees ke doosre hisse se nikali."
"1384","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sona sone se na becho magar misl ba misl; aur un ke baaz ko baaz par zyada na karo. Chandi chandi se na becho magar misl ba misl naqd aur un ke baaz ko baaz par zyada na karo. Aur un mein se ghaib ko hazir se na becho."
"1385","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sona sone se na becho magar misl ba misl; aur ghaib ko hazir se na becho."
"1386","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di: Unhein apne dada Malik bin Aamir se, Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) se pahunchi, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Deenar ko do deenar se na becho, aur na dirham ko do dirham se."
"1387","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Musa bin Abi Tameem se, Sa'id bin Yasar se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Deenar ba deenar aur dirham ba dirham; un dono ke darmiyan koi fazl nahin."
"1388","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne farmaya: Sona sone se na becho magar misl ba misl aur un ke baaz ko baaz par zyada na karo; aur chandi chandi se na becho magar misl ba misl aur un ke baaz ko baaz par zyada na karo."
"1389","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Humaid bin Qais se, Mujahid se, Ibn Umar se ke unhon ne farmaya: Deenar ba deenar aur dirham ba dirham; un dono ke darmiyan koi fazl nahin. Yeh hamare Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka hum se ahd hai aur hamara tum se ahd."
"1390","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Zaid bin Aslam se, Ata bin Yasar se: Muawiyah bin Abi Sufyan ne sone ya chandi ka bartan us ke wazan se zyada mein becha. To Abu Darda (Raziyallahu anhu) ne un se farmaya: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko is jaisi se mana farmate suna hai. To Muawiyah ne farmaya: Main is mein koi harj nahin samajhta. To Abu Darda ne farmaya: Mujhe Muawiyah se kaun uzr dega? Main use Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se khabar deta hun aur woh mujhe apni rae khabar deta hai. Main tumhare sath kisi zameen mein nahin rahunga. Pehli Kitab Buyoo' se, aur chauthi ke aakhir tak Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees ke doosre hisse se, paanchwin Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i mein, aur chhathi aur saatwin Kitab Risalah se nikali."
"1391","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Malik bin Aus bin Hadsan se: Unhon ne sau deenar mein sarf manga. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir mujhe Talhah bin Ubaidillah ne bulaya. Phir hum ne bahao kiya yahan tak ke unhon ne mujh se sarf kiya. Aur sona liya use apne haath mein ulat-pulat karne lage. Phir farmaya: Yahan tak ke mera khazin aaye ya meri khazinah Ghaba se aaye. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Mujhe shak hai. Aur Umar sun rahe the. To Umar ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Woh us se alag na ho yahan tak ke woh us se le le. Phir farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sona sone se riba hai magar ha aur ha; khajoor khajoor se riba hai magar ha aur ha; jau jau se riba hai magar ha aur ha. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Main ne use Malik par sahih padha us mein koi shak nahin. Phir mujh par zamana lamba ho gaya aur main ne yaad na rakha. To mujhe meri khazinah ya mere khazin mein shak hua; aur mere siva un se kehte hain: Mere khazin."
"1392","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Malik bin Aus se, Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Malik ki hadees ke mani ki tarah. Aur farmaya: Yahan tak ke mera khazin aaye. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir main ne yaad rakha us mein koi shak nahin."
"1393","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Malik bin Aus bin Hadsan se, Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sona chandi se riba hai magar ha aur ha; burr burr se riba hai magar ha aur ha; khajoor khajoor se riba hai magar ha aur ha; jau jau se riba hai magar ha aur ha."
"1394","[AI-translation] Abdul Wahhab Saqafi ne hamein khabar di, Ayyub se, Muslim bin Yasar aur ek doosre aadmi se, Ubadah bin Samit se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sona sone se na becho, na chandi chandi se, na burr burr se, na jau jau se, na namak namak se magar barabar barabar, ain ba ain, haath ba haath. Lekin sona chandi se becho, chandi sone se, burr jau se, jau burr se, khajoor namak se, namak khajoor se, haath ba haath jaise chaho. Unhon ne farmaya: Aur un dono mein se ek ne khajoor ya namak kam kiya. Abu Abbas Asamm ne farmaya: Meri kitab mein: Ayyub se, Ibn Sireen se, phir unhon ne ustad ki kitab mein nazar se us par kata, yani Rabi'."
"1395","[AI-translation] Abdul Wahhab ne hamein khabar di, Ayyub bin Abi Tamimah se, Muhammad bin Sireen se, Muslim bin Yasar aur ek doosre aadmi se, Ubadah bin Samit se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sona sone se na becho, na chandi chandi se, na burr burr se, na jau jau se, na khajoor khajoor se, na namak namak se magar barabar barabar, ain ba ain, haath ba haath. Lekin sona chandi se becho, chandi sone se, burr jau se, jau burr se, khajoor namak se, namak khajoor se, haath ba haath jaise chaho. Un dono mein se ek ne khajoor ya namak kam kiya, aur un dono mein se ek ne izafa kiya: Jo zyada de ya zyada mange woh soodkhor hua. Yeh chaar hadeesein Kitab Buyoo' se, aur paanchwin Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees se nikali."
"1396","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di ke unhon ne Ubaidullah bin Abi Yazeed ko kehte suna: Main ne Ibn Abbas ko kehte suna: Mujhe Usamah bin Zaid ne khabar di ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Riba sirf udhar mein hai. Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees ke doosre hisse se nikali."
"1397","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo ghalla khareede woh use na beche yahan tak ke use poora le le."
"1398","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Dinar se, Ibn Umar se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo ghalla khareede woh use na beche yahan tak ke use qabz kare."
"1399","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar se, Tawus se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne farmaya: Raha woh jis se Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana farmaya, to woh ghalla hai ke woh becha jaye yahan tak ke poora liya jaye. Aur Ibn Abbas ne apni rae se farmaya: Aur main har cheez ko usi jaisa samajhta hun."
"1400","[AI-translation] Siqah ne hamein khabar di, Ayyub se, Yusuf bin Mahak se, Hakeem bin Hizam se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe us ke bechne se mana farmaya jo mere paas nahin."
"1401","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Salim Qaddah ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Ata bin Abi Rabah se, Safwan bin Mauhab se ke unhon ne use khabar di, Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Saifi se, Hakeem bin Hizam se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya mujhe khabar nahin di gayi, ya kya mujhe nahin pahunchi, ya jaisa Allah ne chaha us mein se: Ke tum ghalla bechte ho? Hakeem ne farmaya: Han aye Allah ke Rasool. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghalla hargiz na becho yahan tak ke use khareedo aur poora lo."
"1402","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Salim ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, unhon ne farmaya: Mujhe Ata ne yeh bhi khabar di, Abdullah bin Ismah se, Hakeem bin Hizam se: Unhon ne use un se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna."
"1403","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar se, Tawus se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne farmaya: Raha woh jis se Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana farmaya, to woh ghalla hai ke woh becha jaye yahan tak ke qabz kiya jaye. Ibn Abbas ne apni rae se farmaya: Aur main har cheez ko usi jaisa samajhta hun. Yeh chaar hadeesein Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees ke doosre hisse se, paanchwin aur chhathi aur Ibn Abbas ke qaul Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i mein, aur saatwin aur Ibn Abbas ke qaul Kitab Risalah se nikali."
"1404","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Yazeed maula Aswad bin Sufyan se: Zaid Abu Ayyash ne unhein khabar di: Unhon ne Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas se baidha ke sult se badle ke bare mein poocha. To Sa'd ne un se farmaya: Un dono mein se kaunsi afzal hai? To unhon ne farmaya: Baidha. To unhon ne is se mana farmaya aur farmaya: Main ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khajoor ke rutab se badle ke bare mein poochte suna. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya rutab kam hoti hai jab woh sookh jaye? To unhon ne farmaya: Han. To Aap ne is se mana farmaya."
"1405","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Salim se, apne walid se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khajoor ke bechne se mana farmaya yahan tak ke us ki pukhtagi zahir ho jaye, aur khajoor ke khajoor se badle se mana farmaya. Abdullah ne farmaya: Hamein Zaid bin Sabit ne hadees bayan ki: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne arayah mein rukhsat di."
"1406","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar se, Ismail Shaibani ya ghair se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne jo mere khajoor ke darakhton ke siron par tha sau wasq mein becha; agar zyada ho to un ke liye, aur agar kam ho to un par. To main ne Ibn Umar se poocha. To unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is se mana farmaya magar Aap ne ariyah ki bai' mein rukhsat di."
"1407","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Abdullah bin Umar se, Zaid bin Sabit se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ariyah wale ko rukhsat di ke woh use us ke andaze se beche."
"1408","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Dawood bin Husain se, Abu Sufyan maula Ibn Abi Ahmad se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne arayah ki bai' mein paanch wasq se kam ya paanch wasq mein rukhsat di. Dawood ko shak hua. Unhon ne farmaya: Paanch wasq ya paanch wasq se kam."
"1409","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Basheer bin Yasar se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Sahl bin Abi Hasmah ko kehte suna: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khajoor ke khajoor se badle se mana farmaya, magar Aap ne ariyah mein rukhsat di ke woh apne andaze se khajoor mein bechi jaye; us ke ghar wale use rutab khayen."
"1410","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Ata se, Jabir se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne muzabanah ki bai' se mana farmaya. Aur muzabanah: Khajoor ka khajoor se badla, magar Aap ne arayah mein rukhsat di. Yeh saat hadeesein Kitab Buyoo' se nikali."
"1411","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne muzabanah se mana farmaya. Aur muzabanah: Khajoor ka khajoor se nap mein badla, aur angoor ka kishmish se nap mein badla."
"1412","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Dawood bin Husain se, Abu Sufyan maula Ibn Abi Ahmad se, Abu Sa'id Khudri ya Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne muzabanah aur muhaqalah se mana farmaya. Aur muzabanah: Khajoor ke darakhton ke siron par khajoor ka khajoor se khareedna. Aur muhaqalah: Zameen ko gehun se kiraye par dena."
"1413","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Sa'id bin Musayyab se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne muzabanah aur muhaqalah se mana farmaya. Aur muzabanah: Khajoor ka khajoor se khareedna. Aur muhaqalah: Kheti ka gehun se khareedna. Ibn Shihab ne farmaya: Phir main ne zameen ke sone aur chandi se kiraye ke bare mein poocha. To unhon ne farmaya: Us mein koi harj nahin."
"1414","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Ata se, Jabir se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mukhabarah, muhaqalah, aur muzabanah se mana farmaya. Aur muhaqalah: Aadmi kheti ko sau faraq gehun mein beche. Aur muzabanah: Woh khajoor ke darakhton ke siron par khajoor ko sau faraq mein beche. Aur mukhabarah: Zameen ka teesre aur chauthe par kiraya."
"1415","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Amr se, Ibn Umar se, unhon ne farmaya: Hum mukhabarah karte the aur us mein koi harj nahin samajhte the yahan tak ke Rafi' ne khayal kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se mana farmaya hai. To hum ne is wajah se use chhod diya. Yeh chaar hadeesein Kitab Buyoo' se, aur paanchwin Kitab Risalah se nikali."
"1416","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Zuhri se, Salim se, apne walid se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne phalon ke bechne se mana farmaya yahan tak ke un ki pukhtagi zahir ho jaye."
"1417","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne phalon ke bechne se mana farmaya yahan tak ke un ki pukhtagi zahir ho jaye; Aap ne bechne wale aur khareedne wale ko mana farmaya."
"1418","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Abdullah bin Dinar se, Ibn Umar se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne, yani usi ki tarah."
"1419","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Humaid Taweel se, Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne phalon ke bechne se mana farmaya yahan tak ke woh tuzhi hon. Kaha gaya: Aye Allah ke Rasool, tuzhi kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Yahan tak ke surkh hon. Aur Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhara kya khayal hai jab Allah phal rok le, to tum mein se koi apne bhai ka maal kis cheez se lega?"
"1420","[AI-translation] Saqafi ne hamein khabar di, Humaid se, Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khajoor ke phal ke bechne se mana farmaya yahan tak ke woh tazhu ho. Kaha gaya: Aur tazhu kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Surkh ho."
"1421","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abu Rijal se, Amrah se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne phalon ke bechne se mana farmaya yahan tak ke woh aafat se mehfooz ho jayen."
"1422","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Fudaik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Abi Zi'b se, Usman bin Abdullah bin Suraqah se, Abdullah bin Umar se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne phalon ke bechne se mana farmaya yahan tak ke aafat chali jaye. Usman ne farmaya: Phir main ne Abdullah se kaha: Woh kab hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Surayya ke tulu' par."
"1423","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Salim ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Ata se, Jabir se, insha Allah: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne phal ke bechne se mana farmaya yahan tak ke us ki pukhtagi zahir ho jaye. Ibn Juraij ne farmaya: Phir main ne kaha: Kya Jabir ne khajoor ke darakht ya khajoor ko khaas kiya? Unhon ne farmaya: Balke khajoor ke darakht ko. Aur hum har phal ko usi jaisa samajhte hain."
"1424","[AI-translation] Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Amr se, Tawus se: Unhon ne Ibn Umar ko kehte suna: Phal khareeda nahin jata yahan tak ke us ki pukhtagi zahir ho jaye. Aur hum ne Ibn Abbas se suna ke woh kehte hain: Phal becha nahin jata yahan tak ke khaya jaye."
"1425","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar se, Abu Ma'bad se, mera khayal hai Ibn Abbas se, ke woh apne ghulam se khajoor khane se pehle bechte the, aur woh apne aur apne ghulam ke darmiyan riba nahin samajhte the. Yeh das hadeesein Kitab Buyoo' se nikali."
"1426","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Humaid bin Qais se, Sulaiman bin Ateeq se, Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne saalon ki bai' se mana farmaya, aur aafat ka waza karne ka hukm farmaya. Shafi'i ne farmaya: Main ne Sufyan ko yeh hadees bahut baar hadees bayan karte suna, un ke sath meri lambi suhbat mein jo main ne unhein hadees bayan karte suna us ki kasrat se gina nahin; us mein zikr nahin hota tha: Aafat ka waza karne ka hukm. Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne saalon ki bai' se mana farmaya, is se zyada nahin. Phir unhon ne us ke baad izafa kiya: Aur aafat ka waza karne ka hukm. Sufyan ne farmaya: Humaid saalon ki bai' ke baad aafat ke waza se pehle ek baat zikr karte the jo mujhe yaad nahin. Aur main aafat ke waza ke zikr se rukta tha; kyunke main nahin janta baat kaisi thi; aur hadees mein aafat ka waza karne ka hukm hai."
"1427","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Abu Zubair se, Jabir se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se usi ki tarah."
"1428","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Abu Rijal se, apni walida Amrah se ke unhon ne unhein kehte suna: Ek aadmi ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein ek bagh ki khajoor khareedi. Phir us ne us ki dekh-bhal ki aur us par thehra raha yahan tak ke use nuqsan zahir ho gaya. To us ne bagh ke malik se manga ke woh waza kare. To us ne qasam khayi ke woh nahin karega. To khareedne wale ki maan Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas gayi aur unhein yeh zikr kiya. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ne qasam khayi ke woh khair nahin karega? To maal ke malik ne yeh suna. To woh Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur bola: Aye Allah ke Rasool, woh us ke liye hai. Yeh teen hadeesein Kitab Buyoo' se nikali."
"1429","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Humaid bin Qais se, Sulaiman bin Ateeq se, Jabir se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne saalon ki bai' se mana farmaya."
"1430","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Abu Zubair se, Jabir se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se usi ki tarah."
"1431","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Amr se, Jabir se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Ibn Zubair ko khajoor ke darakht ki mu'awamah bai' se mana kiya."
"1432","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar se, unhon ne Jabir bin Abdullah ko kehte suna: Main ne Ibn Zubair ko khajoor ke darakht ki mu'awamah bai' se mana kiya."
"1433","[AI-translation] Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Humaid bin Qais se, Sulaiman bin Ateeq se, Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne saalon ki bai' se mana farmaya."
"1434","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Abu Zubair se, Jabir se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se usi ki tarah. Yeh teen hadeesein Kitab Buyoo' se, aur chhathi ke aakhir tak Kitab Muzara'ah wa Kar'il Aradeen se nikali."
"1435","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Abdul Karim se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne farmaya: Wazeefe tak aur angoor ki fasal tak aur anaaj ki katayi tak bai' na karo. Kitab Buyoo' se nikali."
"1436","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sa'id ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Abu Zubair se, unhon ne use khabar di, Jabir bin Abdullah se: Unhon ne unhein kehte suna: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khajoor ke dher ki bai' se mana farmaya jis ka nap maloom na ho, maloom nap ki khajoor se. Kitab Buyoo' se nikali."
"1437","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Ayyub se, Qatadah se, Abu Hassan A'raj se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne farmaya: Main gawahi deta hun ke maloom muddat tak zamanat wala salaf Allah ne apni kitab mein halal farmaya hai, aur us mein ijazat di hai. Phir unhon ne farmaya: Aye iman walon, jab tum maloom muddat tak qarz ka lain-dain karo (Al-Baqarah: 282)."
"1438","[AI-translation] Ibn Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Abi Najeeh se, Abdullah bin Kaseer se, Abul Minhal se, Ibn Abbas se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah tashreef laye jabke woh khajoor mein ek saal aur do saal ka salaf karte the, aur kabhi farmaya: Aur teen. To Aap ne farmaya: Jo salaf kare woh maloom nap mein, maloom wazan mein, maloom muddat tak salaf kare. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir main ne use yaad rakha jaisa main ne Sufyan se kai baar bayan kiya."
"1439","[AI-translation] Mujhe us ne khabar di jis ki main tasdeeq karta hun, Sufyan se ke unhon ne waisa farmaya jaisa main ne kaha. Aur muddat ke bare mein farmaya maloom muddat tak."
"1440","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Abi Najeeh se, Abdullah bin Kaseer se, Abul Minhal se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah tashreef laye jabke woh khajoor mein ek saal, do saal, aur teen ka salaf karte the. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo salaf kare woh maloom nap mein, maloom wazan mein, aur maloom muddat mein, ya maloom muddat tak salaf kare. Yeh teen hadeesein Kitab Buyoo' se, aur chauthi Kitab Ikhtilaful Hadees ke doosre hisse se nikali."
"1441","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Ibrahim bin Muhammad ne hamein khabar di, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se: Woh is mein koi harj nahin samajhte the ke aadmi kisi cheez ko muddat tak beche jabke us ke paas us ki asl na ho."
"1442","[AI-translation] Sa'id ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se usi ki tarah."
"1443","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Salamah bin Musa se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se, unhon ne farmaya: Wohi maroof hai ke woh us ka baaz ghalla aur baaz deenar le. Yeh teen hadeesein Kitab Buyoo' se nikali."
"1444","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Qasim se, unhon ne farmaya: Main ne Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) ko suna jabke ek aadmi un se us shakhs ke bare mein pooch raha tha jis ne saliyon mein salaf kiya. Rabi' ne farmaya: Saliyon. Phir us ne unhein qabz karne se pehle bechna chaha. Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: Yeh chandi ba chandi hai, aur unhon ne ise napasand farmaya. Aur Malik ne farmaya: Aur woh hamare khayal mein is liye ke woh use apne us sathi se bechna chahta tha jis se us ne khareeda tha, us qeemat se zyada par jis par us ne us se khareeda tha. Aur agar woh use us ke siva se bechta jis se us ne khareeda tha, to us ki bai' mein koi harj na hota."
"1445","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Salim ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Ata se: Unhon ne Ibn Abbas ko kehte suna: Hum salaf mein chandi ke badle chandi mein naqd koi harj nahin samajhte."
"1446","[AI-translation] Sa'id ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Amr bin Dinar se: Ibn Umar use jaiz karte the. Pehli Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i mein, aur doosri aur teesri Kitab Buyoo' se nikali."
"1447","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik bin Anas ne hamein khabar di, Zaid bin Aslam se, Ata bin Yasar se, Abu Rafi' se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi se jawan oont udhar liya. Phir Aap ke paas sadaqah ke oonton mein se oont aaye. Aur Aap ne mujhe hukm diya ke main use use ada karun."
"1448","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Zaid bin Aslam se, Ata bin Yasar se, Abu Rafi' maula Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jawan oont udhar liya. Phir Aap ke paas sadaqah ke oont aaye. Abu Rafi' ne farmaya: Phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe hukm diya ke main us aadmi ka jawan oont ada karun. To main ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, main ne oonton mein umdah chaar saalah oont ke siva nahin paya. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use use de do; logon mein se behtareen woh hai jo ada karne mein behtareen hai."
"1449","[AI-translation] Siqah ne hamein khabar di, Sufyan Sauri se, Salamah bin Kuhail se, Abu Salamah se, Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se usi mani ki tarah. Pehli Kitab Zakat se, aur doosri aur teesri Kitab Buyoo' se nikali."
"1450","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Siqah ne hamein khabar di, Lais se, Abu Zubair se, Jabir se, unhon ne farmaya: Ek ghulam aaya aur Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hijrat par bai'at ki; Aap ne nahin suna ke woh ghulam hai. Phir us ka aaqa use mangne aaya. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use bech do. Phir Aap ne use do kaale ghulamon se khareeda. Phir Aap ne us ke baad kisi se bai'at nahin li yahan tak ke us se poochte: Kya woh ghulam hai ya aazad."
"1451","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Salim ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Abdul Karim Jazari se, unhon ne use khabar di, ke Ziyad bin Abi Tameem maula Usman bin Affan ne use khabar di: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apna ek musaddiq bheja. To woh musinnah sawari ke oont laya. Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhein dekha, Aap ne farmaya: Tum halaak hue aur halaak kiya. To us ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, main do aur teen jawan oont musinnah sawari ke oont se naqd bechta tha. Aur main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sawari ki hajat janta tha, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: To phir aise hi hai."
"1452","[AI-translation] Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Tawus se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se ke un se ek oont ke do oont se badle ke bare mein poocha gaya. Unhon ne farmaya: Kabhi ek oont do oonton se behtar hota hai."
"1453","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Salih bin Kaisan se, Hasan bin Muhammad bin Ali se, Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se ke unhon ne apna ek oont jise Usaifir kaha jata tha bees oonton mein muddat tak becha."
"1454","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se ke unhon ne ek sawari chaar oonton mein khareedi jo un par zamanat the jinhein us ka malik Rabzah mein ada karega."
"1455","[AI-translation] Aur usi se Ibn Umar se: Unhon ne ek sawari chaar oonton mein khareedi jo un par Rabzah mein zamanat the. Yeh paanch hadeesein Kitab Buyoo' se, aur chhathi Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i mein nikali."
"1456","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Muslim ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Juraij se, Qasim bin Abi Bazzah se, unhon ne farmaya: Main Madinah aaya. To main ne ek oont paya jo zibah kiya gaya tha aur tukde-tukde taqseem kiya gaya tha; us ka har tukda ek bakri ke bachche se. To main ne us mein se ek tukda khareedna chaha. To Madinah walon mein se ek aadmi ne mujh se kaha: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne zinda ko murda se bechne se mana farmaya hai. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir main ne us aadmi ke bare mein poocha. To mujhe us ke bare mein khair khabar di gayi."
"1457","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Yahya ne hamein khabar di, Salih maula Tauamah se, Ibn Abbas se, Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Unhon ne janwar ke gosht se badle ko napasand farmaya. Dono hadeesein Kitab Sarf se nikali."
"1458","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sa'id bin Salim ne hamein khabar di, Musa bin Ubaidah se, Sulaiman bin Yasar se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Woh bakri ki pusht par oon ke aur bakri ke thanon mein doodh ki bai' ko nap mein baghair napasand karte the. Kitab Buyoo' se nikali."
"1459","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hamein khabar di, Shabeeb bin Gharqadah se: Unhon ne qabile ko Urwah bin Ja'd se hadees bayan karte suna: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhein ek deenar diya take woh Aap ke liye us se bakri ya qurbani khareeden. To unhon ne Aap ke liye do bakriyan khareedin. Phir un mein se ek ek deenar mein bechi aur Aap ke paas bakri aur deenar laye. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ke liye un ki bai' mein barkat ki dua farmayi. Phir agar woh mitti khareedte to us mein nafa kamate."
"1460","[AI-translation] Unhon ne farmaya: Yeh hadees Sufyan bin Uyainah ke siva ne Shabeeb bin Gharqadah se riwayat ki aur use milaya; woh use Urwah bin Abil Ja'd se is qisse ya us ke mani ke sath riwayat karte hain. Dono hadeesein Kitab Ruhn wal Ijarat se nikali."
"1461","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Zaid bin Aslam se, Ibn Wa'lah Misri se: Unhon ne Ibn Abbas se us ke bare mein poocha jo angoor se nichoda jata hai. To Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Ek aadmi ne Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko sharab ki mashk tohfe mein di. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum nahin jante ke Allah ne use haram farmaya hai? To us ne kaha: Nahin. To us ne apne pehlu wale ek insan se sargoshi ki. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne us se kya sargoshi ki? To us ne kaha: Main ne use use bechne ka hukm diya. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne us ke peene ko haram farmaya us ne us ke bechne ko haram farmaya hai. To us ne dono mashken khol din yahan tak ke jo un mein tha chala gaya."
"1462","[AI-translation] Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar se, Tawus se, Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne farmaya: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ko pahunchi ke ek aadmi ne sharab bechi. To unhon ne farmaya: Allah fulan ko halaak kare jis ne sharab bechi. Kya woh nahin janta ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Yahood ko halaak kare; un par charbi haram ki gayi thi aur unhon ne use pighlaya aur becha."
"1463","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se: Iraq walon mein se aadmiyon ne kaha: Hum khajoor ke darakht ki khajoor aur angoor se khareedte hain. Phir hum use nichod kar sharab banate hain aur bechte hain. To Abdullah ne farmaya: Main tum par Allah ko, us ke farishton ko, aur jo jinn aur insan mein se sunta hai gawah banata hun ke main tumhein use bechne ka hukm nahin deta, na use khareedo, na use nichodo, na use pilao; kyunke woh shaitan ke kaam se gandagi hai. Yeh teen hadeesein Kitab Ashribah se nikali."
"1464","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman se, Abu Mas'ud Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kutte ki qeemat, zaniyah ke meher, aur kahin ke halwan se mana farmaya."
"1465","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman bin Haris bin Hisham se, Abu Mas'ud Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kutte ki qeemat, zaniyah ke meher, aur kahin ke halwan se mana farmaya. Malik ne farmaya: Shikari aur ghair shikari kutton ki bai' sirf is liye napasand ki gayi kyunke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kutte ki qeemat se mana farmaya hai. Pehli Kitab Buyoo' se, aur doosri aur Malik ke qaul Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i mein nikali."
"1466","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Rabi'ah bin Abi Abdur Rahman se, Hanzalah bin Qais se: Unhon ne Rafi' bin Khadij se zameen ke kiraye ke bare mein poocha. To unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne zameen ke kiraye se mana farmaya hai. Phir us ne kaha: Sone aur chandi se? To unhon ne farmaya: Raha sona aur chandi, to us mein koi harj nahin."
"1467","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Sa'id bin Musayyab se: Un se zameen ke sone aur chandi se kiraye ke bare mein poocha gaya. To unhon ne farmaya: Us mein koi harj nahin."
"1468","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Hisham bin Urwah se, apne walid se usi jaisa."
"1469","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Salim se usi ki tarah."
"1470","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Yahya ne hamein khabar di, Amr bin Dinar se, Ibn Umar se: Woh us par shart lagate the jo un se zameen kiraye par leta ke woh use khad na de. Aur yeh us se pehle tha ke Abdullah kiraya chhod dete. Yeh chaar hadeesein Kitab Ruhn wal Ijarat se, aur paanchwin Kitab Da'awa wal Bayyinat se nikali."
"1471","[AI-translation] Shafi'i (Raziyallahu anhu) ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne farmaya: Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Ibn Musayyab se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Yahood se farmaya jab Khaibar fatah kiya: Main tumhein us par qayam rakhta hun jis par Allah ne tumhein qayam rakha hai: Phal hamare aur tumhare darmiyan. To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Ibn Rawahah ko bhejte aur woh Aap ke aur un ke darmiyan andaza karte. Phir farmate: Agar tum chaho to tumhare liye; aur agar tum chaho to mere liye."
"1472","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Sa'id bin Musayyab (Raziyallahu anhu) se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Khaibar ke Yahood se farmaya jab Khaibar fatah kiya: Main tumhein qayam rakhta hun jab tak Allah Ta'ala tumhein qayam rakhe: Khajoor hamare aur tumhare darmiyan. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Abdullah bin Rawahah ko bhejte aur woh un par andaza karte. Phir farmate: Agar tum chaho to tumhare liye; aur agar tum chaho to mere liye. To woh lete."
"1473","[AI-translation] Malik ne hamein khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Sulaiman bin Yasar se: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Abdullah bin Rawahah ko bhejte aur woh Aap ke aur Yahood ke darmiyan andaza karte. Pehli Kitab Ikhtilaf Malik wash Shafi'i mein, aur doosri aur teesri Kitab Zakat se nikali."
